that our intentions were pure.

1088
00:45:18.170 --> 00:45:20.800
And one of the women then

1089
00:45:20.800 --> 00:45:23.810
gave us this incredible tour of the space.

1090
00:45:23.810 --> 00:45:26.610
There's a greenhouse there where they're growing plants,

1091
00:45:27.580 --> 00:45:29.350
