1092
00:45:29.350 --> 00:45:34.290
kind of mini installations throughout the space.

1093
00:45:34.290 --> 00:45:37.520
And it was kind of an amazing experience.

1094
00:45:37.520 --> 00:45:39.490
It's kind of a reclaimed area

1095
00:45:39.490 --> 00:45:41.080
