1105
00:46:06.430 --> 00:46:07.790
This is a place of grieving.

1106
00:46:07.790 --> 00:46:11.283
This is not for your Instagram moment.

1107
00:46:11.283 --> 00:46:16.283
This is a place that is that is somber.

1108
00:46:17.810 --> 00:46:20.290
They need that, though.
Please act accordingly,

1109
00:46:20.290 --> 00:46:21.853
essentially.

1110
00:46:21.853 --> 00:46:24.203
And just,

1111
00:46:27.550 --> 00:46:29.060
you realize how much thought

1112
00:46:29.060 --> 00:46:30.400
