00:50:43.410 --> 00:50:46.958
that we all think we know something,

1197
00:50:46.958 --> 00:50:49.540
and then you get there and there's a whole 'nother depth

1198
00:50:49.540 --> 00:50:51.540
to it that we hadn't really anticipated.

1199
00:50:51.540 --> 00:50:56.330
I think that when it comes to how polarized we are

