1203
00:51:06.860 --> 00:51:09.710
The less you know, the more sure you are of your opinion.

1204
00:51:10.890 --> 00:51:13.450
And I think that that's where a lot of that comes from.

1205
00:51:13.450 --> 00:51:15.490
And we're somehow calcified

1206
00:51:15.490 --> 00:51:18.780
