1207
00:51:18.780 --> 00:51:20.950
And we do it to ourselves, and we're the product.

1208
00:51:20.950 --> 00:51:22.630
We've talked about it with technology.

1209
00:51:22.630 --> 00:51:24.370
And I think you're dealing with a little bit of that.

1210
00:51:24.370 --> 00:51:29.363
I think that's why it's so cool that you are wanting to flex

1211
00:51:30.990 --> 00:51:34.480
