1214
00:51:42.270 --> 00:51:44.920
That's what, to me, that's what you're after.

1215
00:51:44.920 --> 00:51:47.410
Yeah, flex might be the wrong word.

1216
00:51:47.410 --> 00:51:51.230
I went there with a lot of humility and appreciation

