1222
00:52:07.530 --> 00:52:09.960
the issues that are at play that I think,

1223
00:52:09.960 --> 00:52:12.530
look, Minneapolis is a test case.

1224
00:52:12.530 --> 00:52:15.470
Yes, it's about the current and future state of Minneapolis.

1225
00:52:15.470 --> 00:52:19.580
But to again, use the word referendum,

1226
00:52:19.580 --> 00:52:22.320
