1230
00:52:33.550 --> 00:52:38.550
And that's why the world was watching this 24 hours a day.

1231
00:52:38.800 --> 00:52:41.900
I think, you talk about, with Jeremiah in that episode,

1232
00:52:41.900 --> 00:52:46.750
