But I had the opportunity

1687
01:12:52.093 --> 01:12:52.926
to train with all-
But you were

1688
01:12:52.926 --> 01:12:53.759
a Stanford swimmer.
These Olympians,

1689
01:12:53.759 --> 01:12:56.800
