2323
01:40:04.710 --> 01:40:08.100
They're brewing with disease or, that's what's gross.

2324
01:40:08.100 --> 01:40:09.510
That's the real problem.
That's the ick factor.

2325
01:40:09.510 --> 01:40:12.730
So to the extent that we can produce meat

2326
01:40:12.730 --> 01:40:13.790
without the suffering

2327
01:40:13.790 --> 01:40:18.790
and without all of these upstream problems,

2328
01:40:19.030 --> 01:40:22.290
certainly, that's gonna be more palatable,

2329
01:40:22.290 --> 01:40:25.130
but there's gonna be an arc

2330
01:40:25.130 --> 01:40:29.660
