that I don't think we brought up in the podcast

2399
01:43:12.130 --> 01:43:16.240
is that she said she actually does swim with him.

2400
01:43:16.240 --> 01:43:17.103
'Cause there was some-
I was very happy

2401
01:43:17.103 --> 01:43:17.936
to hear that.
Speculation.

2402
01:43:17.936 --> 01:43:19.470
Like his son, towards the end,

2403
01:43:19.470 --> 01:43:20.950
his son gets in the water with them.

2404
01:43:20.950 --> 01:43:23.010
But now his wife also swims with the group.

2405
01:43:23.010 --> 01:43:24.390
