2413
01:43:38.610 --> 01:43:40.150
Listener questions.

2414
01:43:40.150 --> 01:43:44.750
This is Steven from Charleston, South Carolina.

2415
01:43:44.750 --> 01:43:45.660
Hey Rich.

2416
01:43:45.660 --> 01:43:47.850
This is Steven Jackson calling in

2417
01:43:47.850 --> 01:43:50.090
from Charleston, South Carolina.

2418
01:43:50.090 --> 01:43:51.440
Just calling in with a question

2419
01:43:51.440 --> 01:43:54.370
about what to do when you feel

2420
01:43:54.370 --> 01:43:59.110
like you've hit a wall motivation-wise?

2421
01:43:59.110 --> 01:44:03.120
So I signed up for the 4x4x48,

2422
01:44:03.120 --> 01:44:05.010
and just feeling pumped after doing

2423
01:44:05.010 --> 01:44:06.910
a couple of events before that,

2424
01:44:06.910 --> 01:44:10.080
that my ultra running journey

2425
01:44:10.080 --> 01:44:12.120
was just on an upward momentum,

2426
01:44:12.120 --> 01:44:17.120
and trained really well for the 4x4 and did really well.

2427
01:44:17.160 --> 01:44:19.910
But afterwards, I feel like I have just hit a wall

2428
01:44:19.910 --> 01:44:23.130
with motivation to keep going,

2429
01:44:23.130 --> 01:44:24.820
and keep training for the next thing.

2430
01:44:24.820 --> 01:44:28.860
So yeah, in your experience and Adam's experience,

2431
01:44:28.860 --> 01:44:33.460
what are some tips to overcome that little bit of plateau

2432
01:44:33.460 --> 01:44:37.720
or valley after a big event like that and get back

2433
01:44:37.720 --> 01:44:40.210
on the road, feeling good and feeling motivated?

2434
01:44:40.210 --> 01:44:43.490
So yeah, man, thanks so much for all you guys do.

2435
01:44:43.490 --> 01:44:45.053
Love the pod, the books.

2436
01:44:45.910 --> 01:44:49.270
I've been a follower now for two years or so,

2437
01:44:49.270 --> 01:44:51.520
and hugely inspirational.

2438
01:44:51.520 --> 01:44:56.210
Thank you for impacting so many people, including myself.

2439
01:44:56.210 --> 01:44:58.440
So yeah, man, thanks, bye.

2440
01:44:58.440 --> 01:44:59.870
Have you been to Charleston?

2441
01:44:59.870 --> 01:45:01.310
I have not.

2442
01:45:01.310 --> 01:45:02.210
I've been to Savannah,

2443
01:45:02.210 --> 01:45:03.710
which is like Charleston, Jr.

2444
01:45:03.710 --> 01:45:05.910
Charleston is such a cool place.

2445
01:45:05.910 --> 01:45:07.370
